---
title: GitHub CI Workflows
---
%% Characters Mermaid would misread inside a label are written as entity codes,
%% which render as the character itself: #58; ':', #59; ';', #40; '(', #41; ')',
%% #123; '{', #125; '}'. See "Keeping Charts Parseable" in CLAUDE.md.
sequenceDiagram
    actor Dev as Developer
    participant FB as Feature Branch
    participant M as master
    participant SVN as WordPress.org SVN

    rect rgb(230, 240, 255)
        Note over FB,M: PR → master (pr-checks.yml)
        Dev->>FB: push changes
        FB->>M: open PR
        activate M
        M->>M: composer lint (phpcs)
        M->>M: composer test (phpunit) → composer validate:container
        M->>M: pnpm lint:js
        M->>M: pnpm test (Vitest)
        M->>M: pnpm typecheck
        M->>M: pnpm license:verify
        M->>M: pnpm contracts:verify (every contract chart parses in Mermaid)
        M->>M: composer zip:production (composer check → production build → zip → package:verify) → Plugin Check Action on dist/battery-surf-bench (every check at every severity, warnings fail#59; separate job)
        M->>M: pnpm test:e2e (Playwright + WP Playground, authenticated server#59; separate job)
        M->>M: pnpm test:e2e:unauth (Playwright + WP Playground, login-free server#59; separate job)
        deactivate M
        M-->>FB: checks pass
        Dev->>M: merge PR
    end

    rect rgb(224, 255, 230)
        Note over M: Push → master, post-merge (merge-checks.yml)
        activate M
        M->>M: composer lint (phpcs)
        M->>M: composer test (phpunit) → composer validate:container
        M->>M: pnpm lint:js
        M->>M: pnpm test (Vitest)
        M->>M: pnpm typecheck
        M->>M: pnpm license:verify
        M->>M: pnpm contracts:verify (every contract chart parses in Mermaid)
        M->>M: composer zip:production (composer check → production build → zip → package:verify) → Plugin Check Action on dist/battery-surf-bench (every check at every severity, warnings fail#59; separate job)
        M->>M: pnpm test:e2e (Playwright + WP Playground, authenticated server#59; separate job)
        M->>M: pnpm test:e2e:unauth (Playwright + WP Playground, login-free server#59; separate job)
        deactivate M
    end

    rect rgb(255, 240, 220)
        Note over Dev,SVN: Push a version tag → WordPress.org (deploy.yml, wordpress-org environment)
        Dev->>M: push tag (bare version, e.g. 1.0.1)
        activate M
        M->>M: pnpm release:version (tag = plugin Version = readme Stable tag)
        M->>M: composer zip:production (composer check → production build → zip → package:verify)
        M->>SVN: 10up/action-wordpress-plugin-deploy#58; dist/battery-surf-bench → trunk/ + tags/VERSION/, .wordpress-org/ → assets/
        deactivate M
        Note over Dev,SVN: Manual run (workflow_dispatch) — same steps as a dry run, nothing committed to SVN
    end
